{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"pwd && rg --files -g 'AGENTS.md' -g 'RULES.md' -g 'GOAL.md' -g 'stem-separation-plan.md' -g 'pyproject.toml' -g 'README*' | sort && git status --short --branch && git log --oneline -8\"","aggregated_output":"/Users/marekkucharski/projects/.pm-worktrees/vgt/issue-44\nAGENTS.md\nREADME.md\nRULES.md\ndocs/AGENTS.md\ndocs/GOAL.md\ndocs/stem-separation-plan.md\npyproject.toml\n## issue-44-m1-e-consolidate-vgt-artifacts-under-a-v...origin/main [ahead 2, behind 12]\n2a2adf0 fix(artifacts): migrate known legacy analysis files\n241beb3 feat(artifacts): consolidate vgt regenerable artifacts under vgt/<namespace>/\n4c4cfb2 Merge pull request #49 from mrkkucharski/issue-43-m1-a-operation-model-separator-seam-fake\nb075659 chore(pm): start review issue #43 (claude)\n86ffe0a feat(separation): add operation model, Separator seam, and FakeSeparator (M1-A)\n9f36694 chore(pm): start issue #43 (claude)\nbda844d docs: add M1 stem-separation plan (LALAL v1) and pull it into scope as Phase 2\nbe6f8d3 Merge pull request #42 from mrkkucharski/issue-41-problem-in-initialization\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
